e endpoints.\nExpected answer: 4≤x≤9"},{"id":"MGX-ICW-ARE-3","qualification":"IGCSE","programme":"weekly","exam_tier":"Extended","topic":"Trigonometry · Exact area","prompt":"Two sides of a triangle are \\(10\\text{ cm}\\) and \\(14\\text{ cm}\\) with an included angle of \\(30^\\circ\\). Find its exact area.","marks":4,"difficulty":4,"minutes":6,"scheme":"M1: Use ½ab sinC. M1: Substitute lengths. M1: Evaluate sin30°. A1: Correct area.\nExpected answer: 35 cm²"}]$content$::jsonb) LOOP
